      "offset": "0x2ffafa",
      "back_en": "Bu-bu-bu-bu-bu-bu...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Onomatopeia."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffb16",
      "back_en": "H-H-H-How could such a terrible fate befall us...!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'dire course'→'destino terrível', aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffc93",
      "back_en": "Nyargh!",
