    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffc9b",
      "back_en": "A-A moment, Master Dekopompo!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffce4",
      "back_en": "W-W-Well... by such testimony overheard, Her\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel com ceceio."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffd13",
      "back_en": "Highness may still be imprisoned in the palace...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffd94",
      "back_en": "N-Nyergh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffda0",
      "back_en": "If such oath be true, then it is our duty\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'oaths'→'juro' (singular informal), leve."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffeae",
      "back_en": "Nyuh?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fffe8",
      "back_en": "And having won the Princess's heart,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30001a",
      "back_en": "it's a matter of time until you become the next\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300071",
      "back_en": "And being his right hand man... Oho!\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300098",
      "back_en": "What a promotion for me!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3000d2",
      "back_en": "Oho, ohoo hoo hoo...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Risada."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3001a0",
      "back_en": "Wait!? N-No! That's not what I wanted to\\n",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Waugh'→'Espera' e perde 'outrageous schemes'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3001cc",
      "back_en": "say! How did we come to this!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'schemes' perdido aqui (ver linha anterior)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3004f9",
      "back_en": "Hah... phew... hahh... P-Please wait,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30052a",
      "back_en": "Master Dekopompo!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Lord'→'Mestre', inconsistência leve de título."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3006b8",
      "back_en": "Gah! What--P-Please--Heavens!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Zounds'→'Céus', adequado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3007b6",
      "back_en": "Shichirya. Our sources say that Oshtor\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'said'→'dizem' tempo leve."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3007e4",
      "back_en": "was imprisoned and being interrogated,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30081b",
      "back_en": "Yes. I received reports that he suffered\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Continuação coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300876",
      "back_en": "The princess's dog still had fangs to\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'bite' continua na próxima linha."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3008f1",
      "back_en": "The winds had blown in silence for so long,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'blowing still'→'em silêncio', interpretação aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3009ec",
      "back_en": "E-E-Eegh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300aaa",
      "back_en": "...THERE IS A MAN I HAVE A SCORE TO SETTLE\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'settle things'→'conta a acertar', idiomático ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300ea7",
      "back_en": "I must warn them immediately! Lord Oshtor\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300ed9",
      "back_en": "is in no condition to face him...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'no match'→'sem condições de enfrentá-lo', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x301087",
      "back_en": "Now, what will become of you, Oshtor? Will\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'what will it be'→'o que será de você', leve mas coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3010b3",
      "back_en": "you be incinerated by Vurai's fire? Or will you again\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3011ba",
      "back_en": "I see. So Oshtor took Her Highness...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fd754",
      "back_en": "Lord Dekopompo, look!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fd8ea",
      "back_en": "Yes, my lord. According to the guards' account\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fdacb",
      "back_en": "With the gates open, there's little we can do.\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'little choice'→'pouco podemos fazer', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fe019",
      "back_en": "a moment?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'a word'→'momento', aceitável em fragmento."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fe30a",
      "back_en": "position themselves in silence.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fe46d",
      "back_en": "A-Ah...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fe5a9",
      "back_en": "I think it worked out somehow.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fe6fb",
      "back_en": "Rulie, now's our chance.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fea27",
      "back_en": "palace rooftops.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fec05",
      "back_en": "With a single swing of his arm, the heads\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fed91",
      "back_en": "Wh-What do we do? The others barely left\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2feea2",
      "back_en": "for himself!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento coerente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2fef30",
      "back_en": "A rebellion!? How dare he plan such\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'devise'→'planejar', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ff90e",
      "back_en": "...Hah. If our liege is the radiant sun,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ff9d9",
      "back_en": "And you tell me you haven't come to see this? How\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Inserções coerentes com continuação."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ffa6e",
      "back_en": "Hmhmhm...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Risada."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x3008a3",
      "back_en": "bite... Quite impressive.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300af6",
      "back_en": "Mikazuchi.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nome."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x300fd1",
      "back_en": "sustained during the battle between the Generals\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x30129a",
      "back_en": "We won't leave a stone upon a stone.",
      "verdict": "revise",
